flowchart TD
    accTitle: Module error translation architecture
    accDescr: A controller delegates to a module application service, which raises a typed module exception and reaches the shared RFC 9457 Problem Details adapter through the neutral error contract.

    Controller["Controller"] --> Service["Module application service"]
    Service --> Exception["Typed module exception"]
    Exception --> Neutral["Neutral error contract"]
    Neutral --> Handler["REST exception handler"]
    Handler --> Response["RFC 9457 Problem Details"]
